n though  there was no gun the fear was real three  people were taken to the hospital with  minor injuries  another big talker for people was the  heat now as you're looking at the stage  right now ludicrous is performing but  the heat is to be expected of course a  lot of people saying that there was  water provided a lot of amenities for  people the lovers and friend music  festival concludes tonight reporting  live madison kimbrough live local now
 

